{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30130","headline":"陈情上李景让大夫 · 刘得仁","name":"陈情上李景让大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一被浮名误，旋遭白发侵。\n裴回恋明主，梦寐在秋岑。\n遇物唯多感，居常只是吟。\n待时钳定口，经事压低心。\n辛苦文场久，因缘戚里深。\n老迷新道路，贫卖旧园林。\n晴赏行闻水，宵棊坐见参。\n龟留闲去问，僧约偶来寻。\n望喜潜凭鹊，娱情愿有琴。\n此生如遂意，誓死报知音。\n上德怜孤直，唯公拔陆沈。\n丘山恩忽被，蝼蚁力难任。\n作鉴明同日，听言重若金。\n从兹更无限，翘足俟爲霖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}